      "id": "s02-carrier",
      "intent": "The carrier equation separates dense feature construction from window partitioning, and the window step keeps tokens rather than discarding them.",
      "claim": "\\mathbf{F}=\\mathcal{E}(\\mathbf{I}_{\\mathrm{LR}}),\\qquad \\mathbf{X}=\\mathcal{W}(\\mathbf{F})",
      "narration": "The encoder maps the low-resolution image into F, a dense feature field. The window operator then partitions F into X, keeping the tokens for the thought process.",
